# load_game plan (the autopilot; fixtures/padlogs/load_game.padlog's presses anchored on the GameController states, so the
# route replays at either disc speed and on the PS Vita): the title (7) -> START, the main menu (8) -> LOAD GAME -> the card's
# first save -> LoadingLevel (9) -> Playing (12). Needs the hub card hub_entry.padlog writes (--stop-at 2700 on an empty card).
until-gstate 7 9000
idle 11
hold START 5
until-gstate 8 600
idle 78
hold DOWN 3
idle 47
hold CROSS 5
idle 395
hold DOWN 3
idle 97
hold CROSS 3
until-gstate 9 3000
until-gstate 12 9000
idle 60
stop
